<view class="page"><view class="title">{{form.id ? '车辆档案' : '认识你的爱车'}}</view><view class="subtitle">车牌不是必填项，昵称就能开始记录。</view><view class="field"><view class="label">车辆昵称 *</view><input class="input" value="{{form.name}}" maxlength="30" placeholder="例如：通勤伙伴" data-field="name" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="field"><view class="label">能源类型 *</view><picker range="{{types}}" range-key="name" value="{{typeIndex}}" bindchange="typeChange"><view class="picker">{{types[typeIndex].name}} ▾</view></picker></view><view class="field"><view class="label">品牌 / 车型（选填）</view><input class="input" value="{{form.model}}" maxlength="50" placeholder="例如：品牌与车型" data-field="model" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="field"><view class="label">里程读数 · km *</view><input class="input" type="number" value="{{form.baseMileage}}" placeholder="车辆仪表显示的累计里程" data-field="baseMileage" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="field"><view class="label">该里程的记录日期 *</view><picker mode="date" value="{{form.baseDate}}" end="{{today}}" data-field="baseDate" bindchange="input"><view class="picker">{{form.baseDate}} ▾</view></picker></view><view class="notice">这里保存一次手动里程读数。后续记账会自动更新当前里程；修改时会校验与历史记录是否一致。</view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><button class="primary" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving || !ready}}" bindtap="save">保存车辆</button></view>
